---

1) Vulnerability Description  
The code implements a Cloneable class that contains sensitive information, such as passwords, API keys, or other confidential data. Cloning such objects may result in unintended data exposure or copying of sensitive information, especially if the clone method does not handle sensitive data securely or if the cloning process exposes internal state.

2) Vulnerable Code  
