            }
            return false;
        } catch (IllegalArgumentException e) {
            System.out.println("Invalid credentials provided");
            return false;
        }
        // Avoid catching Exception unless necessary
    }
}
```

---

**Summary:** Refactor the code to avoid catching all exceptions broadly, and handle only expected, specific exceptions to improve robustness, security, and maintainability.

