**Issue:**  
The `if (username != null && password != null)` statement affects only the immediate next statement (`System.out.println("Attempting login");`) because it lacks braces. The subsequent `if (isAdmin)` and `else` blocks are not nested within the first condition and will always execute, regardless of the null check.

